<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bemis raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bemis raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Bemis Co Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 37-1/4.</p>
